    puts stderr {}
    puts stderr {bdftopcf is a font compiler for the X server and font server. Fonts in}
    puts stderr {Portable Compiled Format can be read by any architecture, although the}
    puts stderr {file is structured to allow one particular architecture to read them}
    puts stderr {directly without reformatting. This allows fast reading on the}
    puts stderr {appropriate machine, but the files are still portable (but read more}
    puts stderr {slowly) on other machines.}
}

